WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,280
I am Ye Zhu Qingfeng

2
00:00:01,600 --> 00:00:02,560
My name is Xiao Zhenbei

3
00:00:03,160 --> 00:00:04,360
Can men and women be intimate?

4
00:00:04,360 --> 00:00:08,920
I always feel that the men and women here seem to take the sex of men and women too lightly. Hello, Ms. Zhu, my name is Pu Shan.

5
00:00:08,920 --> 00:00:10,680
You guys only care about looks

6
00:00:10,960 --> 00:00:12,480
In fact, I am also very young, okay?

7
00:00:12,480 --> 00:00:13,960
Now that the move has been completed

8
00:00:14,200 --> 00:00:16,560
I would like to ask Mr. Xiao to do me a favor. What can I do?

9
00:00:16,720 --> 00:00:18,240
I need a refrigerator at my house

10
00:00:18,240 --> 00:00:21,720
Can you please help me move upstairs? Two hundred dollars, Miss Zhu.

11
00:00:22,000 --> 00:00:23,840
Isn't this your home? This doesn't count.

12
00:00:23,840 --> 00:00:26,080
I renovated the house for my parents so they can live in it.

13
00:00:26,080 --> 00:00:27,520
I have an apartment myself on the other side

14
00:00:27,520 --> 00:00:28,480
Two hundred dollars is fine

15
00:00:28,480 --> 00:00:33,200
You know how to ride a motorcycle? Come and ride. I'll sit behind you. What kind of motorcycle is this? Right?

16
00:00:33,200 --> 00:00:34,200
You don’t know about motorcycles?

17
00:00:34,200 --> 00:00:36,440
I thought it was Ma Ma

18
00:00:36,560 --> 00:00:39,800
I can’t tell you’re quite humorous. Do you know how to ride? I can’t.

19
00:00:40,120 --> 00:00:41,720
How many miles can you run in a day?

20
00:00:41,720 --> 00:00:43,160
Ours is not calculated on a day basis.

21
00:00:43,320 --> 00:00:45,000
This is a motorcycle with a displacement of 500cc.

22
00:00:45,080 --> 00:00:47,080
It is very easy to run more than 100 kilometers in one hour

23
00:00:47,080 --> 00:00:48,920
Brother Xiao, more than 100 kilometers in one hour

24
00:00:49,040 --> 00:00:50,400
An hour is half an hour

25
00:00:50,400 --> 00:00:52,800
More than one hundred kilometers is more than two hundred miles, so what will he eat?

26
00:00:52,800 --> 00:00:55,920
Eat gas, gas, gas. I understand.

27
00:00:56,040 --> 00:00:58,200
It's the same kind of car, right?
